   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Monowire<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances a Monowire. The user can start a Grab from up to 6m/yds (3 squares) away by wrapping the wire around the target. While Grappled that way the attacker can attack the defender with the Monowire as though it were an Excellent Quality Very Heavy Melee Weapon, which can't be dodged, but can't use the Choke Action until they close to normal melee range and hold the target with their hands. Switching from a monowire grab to a regular grab takes no Action.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo's required content includes the Edgerunners Mission Kit and Interface RED, and this parent piece comes from there rather than from Cyberpunk RED - Core, which ships no item for it. Make the parent yourself before installing this into it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
